swimlane-beta LR
  accTitle: 订单交接流程
  accDescr: 客户下单后交给仓库拣货和发货，发货完成后交给财务开票。
  subgraph Customer [客户]
    order["提交订单"]
  end
  subgraph Warehouse [仓库]
    pick["拣货"]
    ship["发货"]
  end
  subgraph Finance [财务]
    invoice["开具发票"]
  end
  order -->|订单交接| pick
  pick --> ship
  ship -->|发货信息| invoice
